    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cruel Emperor's army holds the lands captive. A lone hero wielding a cursed blade is all that stands against them...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE CUT, ONE KILL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrusted with a cursed sword, you are able to strike down foes in a single blow. However, your enemies can do the same against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TRECHEROUS JOURNEY...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, block, dodge, deflect, and climb your way through dozens of unique environments over five chapters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ARMY OF FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those loyal to the Emperor seek to eliminate you. Fend off warriors wielding blades, shields, explosives, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466580/extras/7f3ef0c775b8274d79a9fa2917fc91b4.avif?t=1755405612\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not difficult enough? Virtues offer challenges for every level. Can you achieve them all?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cruel Emperor's army holds the lands captive. A lone hero wielding a cursed blade is all that stands against them...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE CUT, ONE KILL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrusted with a cursed sword, you are able to strike down foes in a single blow. However, your enemies can do the same against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TRECHEROUS JOURNEY...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, block, dodge, deflect, and climb your way through dozens of unique environments over five chapters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ARMY OF FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those loyal to the Emperor seek to eliminate you. Fend off warriors wielding blades, shields, explosives, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466580/extras/7f3ef0c775b8274d79a9fa2917fc91b4.avif?t=1755405612\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not difficult enough? Virtues offer challenges for every level. Can you achieve them all?</p>",
